WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.194 --> 00:00:01.027
- I'm Allie.

00:00:01.027 --> 00:00:01.860
- I'm Lexie.

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.107
- [Allie And Lexie] We're the Kaplan twins

00:00:03.107 --> 00:00:05.361
and today we're going to be not identical.

00:00:05.361 --> 00:00:06.528
- For the day.

00:00:09.073 --> 00:00:09.906
- Being an identical twin,

00:00:09.906 --> 00:00:11.552
it's like having a built in best friend.

00:00:11.552 --> 00:00:12.385
- Yeah.
- We do everything together.

00:00:12.385 --> 00:00:13.485
- We're always together.

00:00:13.485 --> 00:00:15.040
- We're artists so we paint together.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.471
- Right, we spend all day together.

00:00:16.471 --> 00:00:18.068
We paint on the same canvas together.

00:00:18.068 --> 00:00:19.449
I don't think we're ever really apart.

00:00:19.449 --> 00:00:20.614
- We're never apart.

00:00:20.614 --> 00:00:23.197
(violin music)

00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:30.831
- We actually didn't know

00:00:30.831 --> 00:00:32.128
- [Allie And Lexie] That
we were identical until,

00:00:32.128 --> 00:00:33.225
like, two years ago.

00:00:33.225 --> 00:00:34.058
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:34.058 --> 00:00:35.187
- It doesn't really work that way.

00:00:35.187 --> 00:00:39.354
If you look alike, it's more
about the science behind it.

00:00:51.321 --> 00:00:52.459
- We got the whole DNA test.

00:00:52.459 --> 00:00:54.103
99.9% same DNA.

00:00:54.103 --> 00:00:55.537
When we thought we were fraternal--

00:00:55.537 --> 00:00:56.430
- My hair would be different.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:57.670
- Yeah, we tried to be different.

00:00:57.670 --> 00:00:58.896
- But since we realized we're identical

00:00:58.896 --> 00:01:00.738
we've been trying to look more alike.

00:01:00.738 --> 00:01:02.088
- Yeah, we definitely
like looking the same

00:01:02.088 --> 00:01:04.218
and also it's just easier when
we get dressed in the morning

00:01:04.218 --> 00:01:06.101
or we have somewhere to go,
she'll put on an outfit,

00:01:06.101 --> 00:01:06.934
and I'll be like,

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:07.849
- [Allie And Lexie] Oh, that looks great.

00:01:07.849 --> 00:01:08.682
- [Lexie] I'm gonna wear that.

00:01:08.682 --> 00:01:09.515
- [Allie] Okay, I'm
gonna do the same thing.

00:01:09.515 --> 00:01:10.348
- [Lexie And Allie] I
don't think this will

00:01:10.348 --> 00:01:12.053
make us wish we looked different.

00:01:12.053 --> 00:01:14.636
(upbeat music)

00:01:32.263 --> 00:01:33.854
- Oh, fuck, wow.

00:01:33.854 --> 00:01:35.593
I look like I should be taller.

00:01:35.593 --> 00:01:36.426
- You look like you should--

00:01:36.426 --> 00:01:39.970
- And wearing a leopard
coat with a martini.

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:41.798
- Yeah.
- And smoking a cigarette.

00:01:41.798 --> 00:01:43.211
When we meet strangers on the
street, they're always like,

00:01:43.211 --> 00:01:44.075
"Oh, are you guys identical?"

00:01:44.075 --> 00:01:45.344
- [Lexie] Are you twins?

00:01:45.344 --> 00:01:46.177
- [Allie] Because we always
talk at the same time.

00:01:46.177 --> 00:01:47.082
We talk over eachother.

00:01:47.082 --> 00:01:48.634
- [Lexie] And especially
when we look exactly alike.

00:01:48.634 --> 00:01:49.784
- [Allie] And we're
wearing the same outfit.

00:01:49.784 --> 00:01:50.617
- Oh, you're twins.

00:01:50.617 --> 00:01:51.450
It's fun.

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:52.283
- Yeah.
- We love it.

00:01:52.283 --> 00:01:53.781
- Now that we look different, right?

00:01:53.781 --> 00:01:54.614
- Yeah.

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:55.543
- We're gonna go talk to some people

00:01:55.543 --> 00:01:59.957
and see if they react.
- See if they think we're--

00:01:59.957 --> 00:02:01.072
- If I saw them on the street,

00:02:01.072 --> 00:02:05.980
I would think that that's
a mother and a daughter.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.921
- She is a twin sister.
- Yes.

00:02:07.921 --> 00:02:09.022
- She's my identical twin.

00:02:09.022 --> 00:02:10.803
- It might be more strange
for us or I don't know

00:02:10.803 --> 00:02:12.713
if we're talking at the
same time with strangers--

00:02:12.713 --> 00:02:13.546
- [Lexie] Maybe it'll be weird.

00:02:13.546 --> 00:02:15.190
They'll be like,--
- [Allie] They'll be confused.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:16.167
- [Lexie] "These people are
really in-sync with each other."

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:17.252
- They're in sync, but
they look different.

00:02:17.252 --> 00:02:18.341
I'm confused.
- Who are they, yeah.

00:02:18.341 --> 00:02:19.642
The Kaplan twins.

00:02:19.642 --> 00:02:21.642
- I'm not chanting that.

00:02:26.273 --> 00:02:27.331
- Our relationship with our mom,

00:02:27.331 --> 00:02:28.530
- [Allie] We're super close.

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:29.830
- [Allie And Lexie]
Sometimes she has a favorite.

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.259
- [Allie] It depends.

00:02:31.259 --> 00:02:32.834
- I'm the favorite right now.

00:02:32.834 --> 00:02:36.158
- I think when Mom sees
this she's gonna be like,--

00:02:36.158 --> 00:02:36.991
- Like, "What?"

00:02:36.991 --> 00:02:38.352
- I think we'll give her a heart attack.

00:02:38.352 --> 00:02:39.685
- But a fun one.

00:02:45.544 --> 00:02:49.127
- You're not excited
to meet the collector?

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:52.404
I don't know, maybe.

00:02:54.649 --> 00:02:56.899
(laughing)

00:03:01.499 --> 00:03:03.185
- Did it give us a mental trip?

00:03:03.185 --> 00:03:05.473
- I feel like it must've
been, I don't know.

00:03:05.473 --> 00:03:06.639
It was just kind of--

00:03:06.639 --> 00:03:07.552
- Some moments were funny.

00:03:07.552 --> 00:03:08.600
Some moments were really weird.

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:09.433
- Confusing.

00:03:09.433 --> 00:03:10.266
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:03:10.266 --> 00:03:11.313
- So, a lot of emotions.

00:03:11.313 --> 00:03:12.846
It was funny.
- It was very funny.

00:03:12.846 --> 00:03:13.801
- [Allie] We tricked a couple people.

00:03:13.801 --> 00:03:16.777
- I think we got away with it.

00:03:16.777 --> 00:03:17.675
- I just want to look the same.

00:03:17.675 --> 00:03:18.862
- No, I think we want to look the same.

00:03:18.862 --> 00:03:19.735
- It just feels weird.

00:03:19.735 --> 00:03:20.668
- It feels, yeah.

00:03:20.668 --> 00:03:21.738
- The whole thing feels weird.

00:03:21.738 --> 00:03:22.858
Time to become identical.

00:03:22.858 --> 00:03:23.783
- Definitely time to become identical.

00:03:23.783 --> 00:03:24.878
- So time.

00:03:24.878 --> 00:03:25.711
- Yeah.
- Need it.

00:03:25.711 --> 00:03:26.625
- Over it.
- Miss you.

00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:27.687
Miss your face.

00:03:27.687 --> 00:03:29.854
Miss my face on your face.

00:03:30.976 --> 00:03:32.876
- [Allie And Lexie] Finally,
we're identical again.

00:03:32.876 --> 00:03:33.709
- Oh, my God.

00:03:33.709 --> 00:03:34.542
I forgot what you looked like.

00:03:34.542 --> 00:03:35.375
- I forgot what I look like.

00:03:35.375 --> 00:03:37.024
- Shh, let me stare at you for a second.

00:03:37.024 --> 00:03:38.204
- I'm so happy.

00:03:38.204 --> 00:03:39.321
- I'm so happy for you.

00:03:39.321 --> 00:03:40.244
- Right?
- Yeah.

00:03:40.244 --> 00:03:41.748
- That was fun, though.
- I know.

00:03:41.748 --> 00:03:42.755
- But I'm back.

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:46.672
(clap)
(laugh)

